,{"name": "Justin Gaethje", "record": "26-5-0 (W-L-D)", "nick_name": "The Highlight", "division": "Lightweight Division", "avatar": "https://ufc.com/images/styles/teaser/s3/2025-03/GAETHJE_JUSTIN_03-08.png?h=a30e7339&itok=ZOGW53qm", "cover": "https://ufc.com/images/styles/athlete_bio_full_body/s3/2025-03/GAETHJE_JUSTIN_L_03-08.png?itok=SzytSved", "page": "https://www.ufc.com/athlete/justin-gaethje", "history": [" (3/8/25) Gaethje won a three round unanimous decision over Rafael Fiziev", " (4/13/24) Gaethje was knocked out by Max Holloway at 4:59 of the fifth round, losing the BMF title ", " (7/29/23) Gaethje knocked out Dustin Poirier at 1:00 of the second round to win the BMF title", "(3/18/23) Gaethje won a three round majority decision over Rafael Fiziev ", " (5/7/22) Gaethje was submitted by Charles Oliveira at 3:22 of the first round in a bout for the vacant UFC lightweight title", " (11/6/21) Gaethje won a three-round unanimous decision over Michael Chandler", " (10/24/20) Gaethje was submitted by Khabib Nurmagomedov via triangle choke at 1:34 of the second round in a fight for the UFC lightweight title", " (5/9/20) Gaethje stopped Tony Ferguson via strikes at 3:39 of the fifth round to win the interim UFC lightweight title", " (9/14/19) Gaethje stopped Donald Cerrone via strikes at 4:18 of the first round", " (3/30/19) Gaethje knocked out Edson Barboza at 2:30 of the first round", " (8/25/18) Gaethje knocked out James Vick at 1:27 of the first round", " (4/14/18) Gaethje was stopped by Dustin Poirier via strikes at :33 of the fourth round", " (12/2/17) Gaethje was knocked out by Eddie Alvarez at 3:59 of the third round", " (7/7/17) Gaethje stopped Michael Johnson via strikes at 4:48 of the second round"], "status": "Active", "home_town": "Tucson, United States", "team": "Genesis Training Center", "style": "MMA", "age": "37", "height": "71.00", "weight": "156.00", "debut": "Jul. 8, 2017", "reach": "70.00", "leg_reach": "40.00", "player_tags": ["#4\n        Lightweight Division", "Active"], "wins_stats": [{"way": "Wins by Knockout", "times": "20"}, {"way": "First Round Finishes", "times": "9"}], "flag": "🇺🇸", "name_cn": " 贾斯汀·盖斯耶（Justin Gaethje）", "nick_name_cn": " 亮点", "history_cn": ["(3/8/25) 盖瑟耶 (Gaethje) 三回合一致判定击败拉斐尔·菲齐耶夫 (Rafael Fiziev)", "(4/13/24) 盖特耶在第五轮4分59秒被马克斯·霍洛威淘汰，失去了BMF冠军", "(7/29/23) Gaethje 在第二轮 1:00 击败达斯汀·普瓦里尔 (Dustin Poirier)，赢得 BMF 冠军", "(3/18/23) 盖瑟耶 (Gaethje) 以三轮多数决定击败拉斐尔·菲齐耶夫 (Rafael Fiziev)", "(5/7/22) 加瑟耶在首轮 3 分 22 秒时被查尔斯·奥利维拉 (Charles Oliveira) 提交，争夺空缺的 UFC 轻量级冠军头衔", "(11/6/21) 盖特杰三回合一致判定战胜迈克尔·钱德勒", "(10/24/20) 加瑟耶在第二轮 1 分 34 秒处被哈比卜·努尔马戈梅多夫 (Khabib Nurmagomedov) 通过三角绞技降服，争夺 UFC 轻量级冠军头衔", "(5/9/20) 盖特耶在第五轮 3 分 39 秒时击倒托尼·弗格森，赢得 UFC 轻量级临时冠军", "(9/14/19) 盖特耶在第一回合 4 分 18 秒时击倒了唐纳德·塞罗尼 (Donald Cerrone)", "(3/30/19) 盖特耶在第一轮2分30秒淘汰埃德森·巴博萨", "(8/25/18) 盖特杰首轮1分27秒淘汰詹姆斯·维克", "(4/14/18) 盖特耶在第四轮 33 秒处被达斯汀·普瓦里尔 (Dustin Poirier) 击倒", "(12/2/17) Gaethje 在第三轮 3 分 59 秒被埃迪·阿尔瓦雷斯 (Eddie Alvarez) 击倒", "(7/7/17) 盖特杰在第二回合 4 分 48 秒时击倒了迈克尔·约翰逊"], "home_town_cn": " 美国图森"}
